 "factor_scores": null,
 "answer_verbatim": "**Best all-in-one starting point: PriceLabs** if you want to both set nightly rates and research a market. Its Dynamic Pricing adjusts rates by date, while its separate Market Dashboards show local metrics such as estimated revenue, occupancy, ADR, and RevPAR. You can also compare similar listings. Note that the market dashboards are a separate paid product.\n\n**If the purchase decision is your main concern, consider AirDNA**: its Rentalizer estimates short-term-rental earnings for a specific address, and its market tools help compare locations and listings. Pair it with a pricing tool once you’re hosting.\n\nTreat any revenue estimate as a starting point, not a guarantee. Check comparable properties, seasonality, local rules, taxes, and your full operating costs before buying.",
